      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Progress%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Trolley cars once ran along what is now U.S. Route 22 until 1936, when the road was widened for growing automobile traffic.",
